.el .ds Aq '
.TH dfdu-cache 1  "dfdu-cache " 
.SH NAME
dfdu\-cache \- List or clear the scans the browser cached, which it opens at once next time
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdfdu cache\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List or clear the scans the browser cached, which it opens at once next time
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dfdu\-cache\-list(1)
List the cached scans, newest first: when each was written, its size, its entries and its directory, and where the cache is
.TP
dfdu\-cache\-clear(1)
Remove every cached scan
.TP
dfdu\-cache\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
